<title>GERMANY: Heidelberger Zement to up 1996 dividend.</title>
<headline>Heidelberger Zement to up 1996 dividend.</headline>
<text>
<p>HEIDELBERG, Germany, April 24, Reuter - Calendar 1996</p>
<p>    Dividend per ordinary share		 1.60 vs 1.50</p>
<p>    Dividend per preference share	     1.80 vs 1.70</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Heidelberger Zement. The company made the announcement in a regulatory statement.</p>
</text>
